    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Portfolio/demo collection for the Smart Treasury Risk Engine project. It is optimized for local mock-mode testing with deterministic sample wallet addresses and a manually triggerable mock block scan."
